---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---

<Layout title="How enquiries work | Shree Ganesh Riddhi Siddhi Traders" description="Understand how to review a machinery listing and discuss product information directly with Shree Ganesh Riddhi Siddhi Traders.">
	<main id="main-content">
		<Breadcrumbs items={[{ label: 'How enquiries work' }]} />
		<article class="container-page editorial-page">
			<p class="eyebrow">Working through a requirement</p><h1>Start with the machine. Confirm the details.</h1>
			<p class="editorial-lede">The catalogue helps you identify equipment to ask about. The business can confirm the information and arrangements relevant to your needs.</p>
			<ol class="service-steps">
				<li><span>01</span><div><h2>Describe the work</h2><p>Share the application, materials, or process you have in mind.</p></div></li>
				<li><span>02</span><div><h2>Review the listing</h2><p>Check any confirmed specifications, images, and price information shown on the product page.</p></div></li>
				<li><span>03</span><div><h2>Ask what is missing</h2><p>Send a question if you need product details or current availability clarified.</p></div></li>
				<li><span>04</span><div><h2>Agree next steps directly</h2><p>Discuss pricing and any supply or delivery arrangements with the business before deciding.</p></div></li>
			</ol>
			<p class="service-note">Specific sourcing, delivery, installation, maintenance, warranty, and training arrangements are not listed here because they need to be confirmed with the business.</p>
			<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Talk about your requirement</a>
		</article>
	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.editorial-page { max-width: 55rem; padding-block: 1rem 5rem; }
	.editorial-page h1 { max-width: 48rem; margin: .5rem 0 1rem; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2.6rem,6vw,4.4rem); letter-spacing: -.06em; line-height: 1.04; }
	.editorial-lede { max-width: 45rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.12rem; }
	.service-steps { margin: 2rem 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
	.service-steps li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr; gap: .8rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 1rem 0; }
	.service-steps li > span { color: var(--link); font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 850; }
	.service-steps h2 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.1rem; }
	.service-steps p { margin: .2rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); }
	.service-note { border-left: 3px solid var(--accent); background: var(--surface); padding: .8rem 1rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .85rem; }
</style>
